{"ref":"BDB, וָו","hw":"וָו","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">וָו</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>hook, pin</strong> or <strong>peg (</strong>etym. unknown<strong>)</strong>—pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָוִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:28\" href=\"/Exodus.38.28\">Ex 38:28</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָוֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:10\" href=\"/Exodus.27.10\">Ex 27:10</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָוֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:32\" href=\"/Exodus.26.32\">Ex 26:32</a> + 5 times;—only P, in description of tabernacle <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:32\" href=\"/Exodus.26.32\">Ex 26:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:37\" href=\"/Exodus.26.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:10\" href=\"/Exodus.27.10\">27:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:11\" href=\"/Exodus.27.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:17\" href=\"/Exodus.27.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:36\" href=\"/Exodus.36.36\">36:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:38\" href=\"/Exodus.36.38\">38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:10\" href=\"/Exodus.38.10\">38:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:11\" href=\"/Exodus.38.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:12\" href=\"/Exodus.38.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:17\" href=\"/Exodus.38.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:19\" href=\"/Exodus.38.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:28\" href=\"/Exodus.38.28\">28</a>, the <em>hooks</em> or <em>pegs</em> of gold and silver, fastened on, or in, the posts of the tabernacle, to support the various hangings (curtains, screens, etc.)","next":"BDB, וזר","prev":"BDB, וָהֵב"}